{"unit_id":"gausszhou__dsh-opencode-session-id#card-zh","repo":"gausszhou/dsh-opencode-session-id","commit":"ec4b9ca952e359b6b0120b35cc3b9de01ba3d668","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-session-id 为 DSH 的 OpenCode 模型请求添加会话标识。插件监听 llm/stream 并用异步本地存储隔离并发会话，再包装 fetch，为发往 opencode.ai 或自定义网关的请求补上会话请求头。默认将 session- 前缀后的标识哈希为稳定的 8 位字母数字 token；无需 API 密钥或额外配置，安装到 DSH profile 后重启即可生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:191-231","lib/index.js:280-313","lib/index.js:315-378","cordis.patch.yml:29-31"]}
